WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.360 --> 01:34.930
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.330 --> 01:37.850
[Episode 57]

4
01:38.710 --> 01:39.920
Four Crossings of the Chishui River,

5
01:38.840 --> 01:41.780
[Shanghai]

6
01:39.920 --> 01:41.350
the bloody battle at the Xiang River,

7
01:41.350 --> 01:43.640
Anshunchang, the Dadu River, Luding Bridge,

8
01:43.640 --> 01:45.200
climbing snow-capped mountains, and crossing the grasslands...

9
01:45.200 --> 01:46.509
Along the way,

10
01:46.560 --> 01:49.160
there have been so many epic and moving events.

11
01:50.150 --> 01:51.280
During the Long March,

12
01:51.280 --> 01:53.150
was Mao Zedong at the front line the whole time?

13
01:53.150 --> 01:53.950
Yes, he was.

14
01:54.200 --> 01:55.000
Who else?

15
01:55.280 --> 01:57.560
Comrades Zhou Enlai, Zhu De,

16
01:57.940 --> 01:59.789
and several other important central leaders.

17
01:59.789 --> 02:00.920
They were all there.

18
02:02.170 --> 02:04.250
Sir, dinner is ready.

19
02:03.270 --> 02:06.170
[Xu Guangping, Lu Xun's Wife]

20
02:04.280 --> 02:06.710
Please invite Mr. Feng to the dining room.

21
02:06.870 --> 02:07.680
Alright.

22
02:08.910 --> 02:10.280
Xuefeng, this way.

23
02:10.310 --> 02:10.870
After you, sir.

24
02:10.870 --> 02:13.130
Please take the seat of honor. After you.

25
02:17.460 --> 02:18.770
Xuefeng, please sit.

26
02:20.280 --> 02:21.000
Sir,

27
02:21.120 --> 02:23.320
didn't the doctor tell you not to drink?

28
02:23.630 --> 02:25.150
I'm just so happy to see Xuefeng.

29
02:25.150 --> 02:26.400
I'll make an exception today.

30
02:26.400 --> 02:27.360
Come, sit down.

31
02:39.430 --> 02:40.750
Here, sir.

32
02:48.210 --> 02:51.260
[Lu Xun]

33
02:49.400 --> 02:51.310
Although I'm in Shanghai,

34
02:51.800 --> 02:54.079
I've been paying constant attention to your movements.

35
02:53.970 --> 02:56.890
[Feng Xuefeng, Special Envoy of the CPC Central Committee]

36
02:54.460 --> 02:58.579
I've even learned to read between the lines of the news now.

37
02:59.520 --> 03:02.030
From the fragments in their newspapers,

38
03:02.030 --> 03:04.230
I analyzed and guessed your itinerary.

39
03:04.910 --> 03:06.710
It wasn't until the end of last year

40
03:06.710 --> 03:08.310
that Agnes Smedley told me

41
03:08.470 --> 03:11.670
the news of your victorious arrival in northern Shaanxi.

42
03:11.680 --> 03:14.340
I was so excited that I couldn't sleep all night.

43
03:15.360 --> 03:17.620
The next morning, I shared this good news

44
03:18.190 --> 03:19.790
with Mao Dun when he visited.

45
03:20.120 --> 03:22.710
We received your joint congratulatory letter,

46
03:22.710 --> 03:24.840
and everyone was greatly encouraged.

47
03:24.910 --> 03:26.840
For people like Mr. Mao Zedong,

48
03:26.840 --> 03:29.030
who are truly

49
03:29.030 --> 03:30.750
keeping their feet firmly on the ground,

50
03:30.750 --> 03:33.400
and shedding their blood and fighting

51
03:33.400 --> 03:35.560
for the survival of the Chinese people today,

52
03:35.560 --> 03:37.360
I consider them comrades

53
03:37.680 --> 03:40.150
and take pride in it.

54
03:41.870 --> 03:45.120
Especially this afternoon after you told me

55
03:45.310 --> 03:47.240
the story of the entire Long March,

56
03:47.310 --> 03:49.430
as well as the Communist Party's proposal

57
03:49.430 --> 03:51.960
for an Anti-Japanese National United Front,

58
03:52.000 --> 03:53.800
I feel deep admiration.

59
03:54.190 --> 03:55.030
It seems

60
03:56.600 --> 03:57.870
I have fallen behind,

61
03:57.960 --> 04:00.090
and I must hurry up to catch up with you.

62
04:00.120 --> 04:00.960
Sir,

63
04:01.080 --> 04:01.780
our Party

64
04:02.000 --> 04:04.060
has always regarded you as a comrade.

65
04:04.870 --> 04:05.870
Did you know that

66
04:05.870 --> 04:07.830
Chairman Mao has told me more than once that on the two fronts

67
04:07.830 --> 04:09.740
of resisting the Kuomintang's military "encirclement and suppression"

68
04:09.740 --> 04:12.280
and cultural "encirclement and suppression,"

69
04:12.280 --> 04:15.120
you have always fought side by side with us.

70
04:15.520 --> 04:18.040
He also said we have two commanders-in-chief:

71
04:18.040 --> 04:19.720
one is Commander-in-Chief Zhu,

72
04:19.720 --> 04:20.600
the other is

73
04:21.269 --> 04:23.270
Commander Lu of the cultural front.

74
04:24.280 --> 04:26.480
I am not qualified to be a commander-in-chief,

75
04:26.480 --> 04:29.070
but I'm fit to be a foot soldier.

76
04:29.070 --> 04:29.730
With my pen.

77
04:31.360 --> 04:32.150
Sir,

78
04:32.750 --> 04:33.560
here's to you.

79
04:37.680 --> 04:38.480
Xuefeng,

80
04:39.920 --> 04:41.720
how is life in northern Shaanxi?

81
04:41.750 --> 04:44.360
Do you have enough to eat and wear?

82
04:44.680 --> 04:46.360
Northern Shaanxi is a barren place,

83
04:46.360 --> 04:48.480
and it's blockaded by the Kuomintang army.

84
04:48.480 --> 04:49.720
When I came here,

85
04:50.480 --> 04:54.120
several central leading comrades were only wearing unlined garments,

86
04:54.120 --> 04:55.780
and food was even more scarce.

87
04:56.070 --> 04:59.130
Everyone had an allowance of only 3 cents a day for food.

88
05:01.390 --> 05:02.000
Here, eat.

89
05:12.560 --> 05:13.360
Guangping,

90
05:14.630 --> 05:17.600
what can you buy for 3 cents in Shanghai?

91
05:19.920 --> 05:21.430
It can buy about

92
05:22.070 --> 05:23.750
a small egg,

93
05:23.920 --> 05:25.780
or a small handful of vegetables.

94
05:26.480 --> 05:27.510
Nowadays,

95
05:28.270 --> 05:30.950
half a kg of pork costs 20 cents,

96
05:31.750 --> 05:34.430
and a foot of cotton cloth costs 9 cents.

97
05:39.270 --> 05:40.870
Shortly after this meeting,

98
05:41.440 --> 05:43.510
Lu Xun entrusted Feng Xuefeng

99
05:43.530 --> 05:46.659
with purchasing a batch of ham, cigarettes, and scarves

100
05:47.000 --> 05:48.730
to be sent to northern Shaanxi.

101
05:49.159 --> 05:50.950
However, due to various reasons,

102
05:50.950 --> 05:53.600
these gifts did not reach their destination.

103
05:54.680 --> 05:56.720
In early October 1936,

104
05:57.240 --> 05:59.430
just days before his death,

105
05:59.430 --> 06:01.560
Lu Xun was still thinking about this matter.

106
06:01.560 --> 06:04.680
He once again entrusted Feng Xuefeng to buy 4 hams

107
06:05.160 --> 06:07.070
along with his personally edited and printed

108
06:07.070 --> 06:10.300
Qu Qiubai's translation collection, "Haishang Shulin",

109
06:10.300 --> 06:12.560
to be sent to northern Shaanxi together.

110
06:12.600 --> 06:15.310
On October 19, 1936,

111
06:15.510 --> 06:17.480
Lu Xun, the greatest and bravest

112
06:17.750 --> 06:20.750
standard-bearer of the new cultural army,

113
06:20.750 --> 06:22.510
passed away in Shanghai.

114
06:23.070 --> 06:26.040
Mao Zedong highly revered Lu Xun throughout his life,

115
06:26.040 --> 06:29.070
calling him "China's first-class saint"

116
06:29.310 --> 06:30.920
and the unprecedented national hero

117
06:30.920 --> 06:33.630
who represented the majority of the entire nation

118
06:33.630 --> 06:35.630
and charged at the enemy

119
06:35.630 --> 06:38.560
as the most correct, brave, resolute,

120
06:38.750 --> 06:41.720
loyal, and enthusiastic

121
06:41.720 --> 06:43.450
fighter on the cultural front.

122
06:46.909 --> 06:48.170
We have talked for so long just now.

123
06:48.170 --> 06:49.240
You must be tired.

124
06:50.120 --> 06:51.040
Not at all.

125
06:51.920 --> 06:55.050
Listening to you talk about the Long March experiences,

126
06:55.210 --> 06:57.500
I was deeply moved by your spirit.

127
06:58.430 --> 06:59.830
Not only am I not tired,

128
07:00.050 --> 07:01.610
but I am also very excited.

129
07:02.270 --> 07:03.000
Mr. Feng,

130
07:03.600 --> 07:04.270
please.

131
07:08.360 --> 07:09.160
Mr. Feng,

132
07:10.390 --> 07:11.390
please also

133
07:11.920 --> 07:13.750
tell your CPC Central Committee

134
07:13.580 --> 07:16.530
[Soong Ching-ling]

135
07:14.070 --> 07:16.630
that I completely agree with your proposal

136
07:17.270 --> 07:20.600
of establishing the Anti-Japanese National United Front,

137
07:20.680 --> 07:24.160
and I am willing to help you with all my might.

138
07:24.240 --> 07:25.240
Madam Ching-ling,

139
07:25.240 --> 07:26.240
thank you so much.

140
07:26.560 --> 07:27.480
With your support,

141
07:27.480 --> 07:29.560
we can carry out our work much better.

142
07:29.560 --> 07:30.490
You are welcome.

143
07:31.040 --> 07:32.100
Please have a seat.

144
07:35.870 --> 07:36.680
In addition,

145
07:38.390 --> 07:40.240
there are two American friends:

146
07:40.870 --> 07:43.750
one is named Edgar Snow,

147
07:44.120 --> 07:45.430
who is a journalist,

148
07:45.800 --> 07:48.600
and the other is George Hatem,

149
07:49.240 --> 07:50.430
who is a doctor.

150
07:50.830 --> 07:52.390
They both expressed to me

151
07:52.390 --> 07:56.430
their desire to go to northern Shaanxi for interviews and work.

152
07:57.190 --> 07:58.870
If possible,

153
07:59.310 --> 08:01.870
I am willing to be their introducer

154
08:02.190 --> 08:04.890
and approach your Central Committee about this matter.

155
08:04.890 --> 08:05.490
Okay,

156
08:05.780 --> 08:08.110
I will report this situation to the Central Committee.

157
08:08.110 --> 08:08.920
Thank you.

158
08:09.480 --> 08:11.210
Please have some tea, Mr. Feng.

159
08:14.270 --> 08:15.070
Also,

160
08:15.900 --> 08:18.170
I have a request

161
08:18.320 --> 08:20.050
regarding our communication.

162
08:20.510 --> 08:23.560
Over the years, it has been very easy

163
08:23.560 --> 08:24.760
for you to contact me.

164
08:25.130 --> 08:27.370
I live in Shanghai all year round.

165
08:28.070 --> 08:29.230
But sometimes,

166
08:29.870 --> 08:32.289
when I have some matters to discuss with you,

167
08:32.289 --> 08:34.000
there is no way to contact you.

168
08:35.240 --> 08:36.200
Could

169
08:36.860 --> 08:38.390
your party please consider

170
08:38.650 --> 08:40.150
sending a party member

171
08:40.179 --> 08:42.780
to establish a year-round connection with me?

172
08:43.150 --> 08:44.000
Rest assured,

173
08:44.430 --> 08:46.960
I'll relay this feedback as soon as possible.

174
08:47.000 --> 08:48.860
I believe it will be solved very soon.

175
08:48.860 --> 08:49.670
Thank you.

176
08:50.510 --> 08:51.700
Please sit down.

177
08:53.870 --> 08:56.680
Not long after, after careful selection,

178
08:57.030 --> 08:58.790
the Shanghai party organization

179
08:58.790 --> 09:02.590
dispatched underground party member Li Yun to serve as the liaison.

180
09:03.080 --> 09:04.080
From then on,

181
09:04.260 --> 09:06.920
the connection between Soong Ching-ling and the CPC Central Committee

182
09:06.920 --> 09:08.780
became more frequent and closer.

183
09:09.900 --> 09:11.830
In July, Edgar Snow

184
09:11.860 --> 09:13.200
and George Hatem,

185
09:13.320 --> 09:15.250
with the help of Soong Ching-ling,

186
09:15.270 --> 09:18.600
successfully arrived in the northern Shaanxi Soviet Area.

187
09:19.660 --> 09:22.720
Given the change in the balance of forces between the enemy and us,

188
09:22.720 --> 09:25.750
the strategic goal of the Eastern Expedition was basically achieved.

189
09:25.750 --> 09:28.200
On May 5, 1936,

190
09:28.480 --> 09:31.360
the Eastern Expedition Red Army entirely crossed the Yellow River westward

191
09:31.360 --> 09:33.360
and marched back to northern Shaanxi.

192
09:33.360 --> 09:34.170
At this point,

193
09:34.440 --> 09:37.910
the 75-day Eastern Expedition operation ended.

194
09:38.920 --> 09:41.780
Just before the return of the Eastern Expedition troops,

195
09:41.780 --> 09:43.950
the then commander of the 28th Red Army,

196
09:43.950 --> 09:45.080
comrade Liu Zhidan,

197
09:45.270 --> 09:47.750
was shot in the chest and died heroically

198
09:48.060 --> 09:51.580
at the young age of 33 on April 14, 1936,

199
09:51.630 --> 09:54.510
during the Sanjiao Town battle

200
09:54.720 --> 09:56.570
for the Yellow River crossing.

201
10:05.480 --> 10:07.030
Although the Eastern Expedition

202
10:07.030 --> 10:08.830
did not achieve our long-term goal

203
10:08.830 --> 10:10.510
of passing through Shanxi and advancing eastward into Hebei,

204
10:10.510 --> 10:13.720
it did force the Jinsui Army back into Shanxi

205
10:13.750 --> 10:15.790
and further restore and consolidate

206
10:15.790 --> 10:17.450
our Shaanxi-Gansu base area.

207
10:18.030 --> 10:19.200
During this eastern expedition,

208
10:19.200 --> 10:21.140
we wiped out seven enemy regiments,

209
10:21.140 --> 10:23.520
captured over 4,000 enemy officers and soldiers,

210
10:23.520 --> 10:24.630
over 4,000 firearms,

211
10:24.630 --> 10:26.360
and more than 20 artillery pieces.

212
10:26.360 --> 10:28.360
We also made economic gains,

213
10:28.720 --> 10:29.750
raising 300,000 silver dollars,

214
10:29.750 --> 10:31.080
which greatly alleviated our difficulties

215
10:31.080 --> 10:32.390
with supplies.

216
10:32.550 --> 10:33.840
It's not just about supplies.

217
10:33.840 --> 10:35.300
During our time in Shanxi,

218
10:35.420 --> 10:37.640
we also recruited over 8,000 new soldiers

219
10:37.640 --> 10:39.120
and sowed the seeds of resistance against Japan

220
10:39.120 --> 10:41.200
in more than 20 counties across the province.

221
10:41.200 --> 10:42.440
Right now, all the troops

222
10:42.440 --> 10:44.440
are scrambling to get a larger share of the new recruits.

223
10:44.440 --> 10:45.300
We must be fair.

224
10:45.800 --> 10:47.190
As it stands, our veteran units

225
10:47.190 --> 10:48.390
are in urgent need of reinforcements,

226
10:48.390 --> 10:51.360
but the local forces in northern Shaanxi also need to be strengthened.

227
10:51.360 --> 10:53.750
Now that our army has expanded to about 30,000,

228
10:53.750 --> 10:56.480
we have more capital to open up new possibilites.

229
10:56.530 --> 10:57.100
Yes.

230
10:57.550 --> 10:59.720
Overall, we've gained a lot.

231
10:59.750 --> 11:01.150
It's worth celebrating.

232
11:02.200 --> 11:04.240
A celebration requires a complete victory.

233
11:04.240 --> 11:05.510
Right now,

234
11:05.790 --> 11:07.750
it's too early to celebrate.

235
11:07.840 --> 11:09.390
Although this eastern expedition

236
11:09.390 --> 11:11.120
did not achieve our long-term goals,

237
11:11.120 --> 11:12.240
it at least

238
11:12.550 --> 11:14.630
solved our most pressing problems.

239
11:15.320 --> 11:17.450
While there are certainly many gains,

240
11:18.600 --> 11:20.660
there is also no shortage of bad news.

241
11:22.390 --> 11:23.210
Indeed.

242
11:24.720 --> 11:27.650
Comrade Zhidan sacrificed his life in Sanjiao Town.

243
11:28.080 --> 11:30.000
I presided over his memorial service,

244
11:30.000 --> 11:32.600
and the whole of northern Shaanxi was in tears.

245
11:33.750 --> 11:35.720
Throughout the eastern expedition,

246
11:35.720 --> 11:38.120
I wore the cotton shoes that Comrade Zhidan

247
11:38.480 --> 11:40.630
asked his wife to make for me.

248
11:41.030 --> 11:42.430
I was still thinking that

249
11:42.510 --> 11:43.720
when I saw him again,

250
11:43.720 --> 11:44.790
I would tell him

251
11:45.320 --> 11:46.870
how warm these shoes are.

252
12:00.270 --> 12:02.030
Hello, Comrade Zhidan.

253
12:02.440 --> 12:04.000
Hello, Chairman Mao.

254
12:04.120 --> 12:05.910
Why don't we sit here and chat?

255
12:06.510 --> 12:08.790
It's a good way to connect with the land of northern Shaanxi.

256
12:08.790 --> 12:10.190
Thank you, Chairman Mao.

257
12:10.750 --> 12:13.000
As long as I can continue working for the Party,

258
12:13.000 --> 12:16.150
I will do whatever the Central Committee asks of me.

259
12:22.150 --> 12:24.480
Comrades, there is also some urgent news.

260
12:24.790 --> 12:27.840
According to intelligence intercepted by the 2nd Bureau,

261
12:27.840 --> 12:30.630
after our eastern expedition forces returned to northern Shaanxi,

262
12:30.630 --> 12:31.750
Chiang Kai-shek established

263
12:31.750 --> 12:33.440
the Shanxi-Shaanxi-Suiyuan-Ningxia Four-Province Border Area

264
12:33.440 --> 12:35.330
"Communist Suppression" Headquarters.

265
12:35.330 --> 12:37.670
Chen Cheng, serving as the Commander-in-Chief,

266
12:37.670 --> 12:39.180
immediately mobilized heavy troops

267
12:39.180 --> 12:40.630
to launch a new round of "suppression" campaigns

268
12:40.630 --> 12:42.480
against the northern Shaanxi base area.

269
12:42.480 --> 12:44.340
The Central Army, the Jinsui Army,

270
12:44.340 --> 12:46.420
and the cavalry forces of the two Mas in Ningxia

271
12:46.420 --> 12:48.750
amounted to no fewer than 200,000 troops.

272
12:50.490 --> 12:53.000
Are there any movements from the Northeast Army?

273
12:53.000 --> 12:54.840
Comrade Li Kenong reported that

274
12:55.000 --> 12:56.000
Zhang Xueliang's

275
12:56.000 --> 12:58.670
attitude towards uniting with us to resist Japan remains unchanged.

276
12:58.670 --> 13:02.150
However, Chiang Kai-shek has been pressuring the Northeast Army,

277
13:02.150 --> 13:05.010
and Zhang is unwilling to openly break with Chiang.

278
13:05.080 --> 13:07.240
He has repeatedly emphasized his hope that we could

279
13:07.240 --> 13:09.480
give up the military stronghold of Wayaobu

280
13:09.480 --> 13:11.740
to give Chiang Kai-shek an explanation.

281
13:11.790 --> 13:13.960
Zhang Xueliang advocates allying with Chiang to resist Japan,

282
13:13.960 --> 13:17.320
which shows he still holds out hope for Chiang.

283
13:17.440 --> 13:18.390
At this time,

284
13:18.510 --> 13:20.670
it wouldn't be good for us to be too tough on him,

285
13:20.670 --> 13:22.630
otherwise our previous united front work

286
13:22.630 --> 13:24.840
would risk falling short of success.

287
13:24.960 --> 13:26.560
From a military perspective,

288
13:26.560 --> 13:28.190
under the heavy siege of enemy forces,

289
13:28.190 --> 13:29.970
it's currently very difficult for us

290
13:29.970 --> 13:31.170
to hold Wayaobu.

291
13:31.370 --> 13:34.040
We might even get bogged down.

292
13:34.910 --> 13:36.790
Northern Shaanxi is vast and sparsely populated.

293
13:36.790 --> 13:38.270
Where will our Central Committee

294
13:38.270 --> 13:39.480
find a place to stay?

295
13:52.390 --> 13:54.030
At this time, the Central Red Army

296
13:54.030 --> 13:56.000
still had not escaped the crisis.

297
13:57.240 --> 13:58.500
Outside the base area,

298
13:58.750 --> 14:01.570
hundreds of thousands of KMT troops

299
14:02.750 --> 14:06.030
Although the eastern expedition solved some supply problems,

300
14:06.030 --> 14:08.190
the fact that northern Shaanxi was vast and sparsely populated

301
14:08.190 --> 14:10.950
with barren land remained unchanged.

302
14:11.840 --> 14:14.640
As the main force returned and troop numbers increased,

303
14:14.640 --> 14:17.570
financial pressure remained difficult to relieve.

304
14:17.910 --> 14:18.840
At this time,

305
14:18.930 --> 14:20.570
the 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps

306
14:20.700 --> 14:24.100
and the 4th Front Army were still marching north.

307
14:24.720 --> 14:26.840
The joining of the 3 main Red Army forces

308
14:26.840 --> 14:29.390
was still full of twists and uncertainties.

309
14:29.550 --> 14:32.360
How to solve this series of difficult problems

310
14:32.510 --> 14:33.320
became

311
14:33.320 --> 14:35.510
a heavy burden weighing on the mind

312
14:35.510 --> 14:36.960
of every central leader.

313
14:52.840 --> 14:53.480
Chairman,

314
14:53.500 --> 14:54.500
where are we going now?

315
14:54.500 --> 14:55.700
Aren't we going back?

316
14:56.790 --> 14:57.850
Take a walk with me.

317
14:58.120 --> 14:59.000
All right.

318
14:59.750 --> 15:01.270
Have my books been sent back?

319
15:01.270 --> 15:02.130
Yes, they have.

320
15:02.270 --> 15:03.500
I even got two large bottles of ink

321
15:03.500 --> 15:04.840
from Wu Jiqing's place,

322
15:04.840 --> 15:06.250
so we don't have to grind ink anymore.

323
15:06.250 --> 15:09.610
Wu was transferred to the Ministry of National Economy,

324
15:09.960 --> 15:11.690
and I got to benefit from it too.

325
15:12.000 --> 15:13.530
He didn't use special privileges for this, right?

326
15:13.530 --> 15:14.170
No, no.

327
15:14.240 --> 15:14.870
I asked about it,

328
15:14.870 --> 15:16.470
and it was bought with money.

329
15:17.550 --> 15:18.270
Changfeng,

330
15:19.440 --> 15:20.840
Wu has been transferred.

331
15:21.720 --> 15:23.520
Do you have any thoughts on this?

332
15:23.610 --> 15:24.280
Reporting to the Chairman,

333
15:24.280 --> 15:25.340
I have no thoughts.

334
15:27.510 --> 15:28.320
Changfeng,

335
15:29.600 --> 15:31.000
you, like everyone else,

336
15:31.440 --> 15:33.480
have gone through the trials of the Long March.

337
15:33.480 --> 15:34.880
You need to make progress

338
15:35.720 --> 15:37.910
and take on more important responsibilities.

339
15:37.910 --> 15:39.120
Chairman, I'm not going anywhere.

340
15:39.120 --> 15:40.450
I'll just be your Guard.

341
15:42.600 --> 15:43.950
You've followed me since you were 15.

342
15:43.950 --> 15:45.660
You can't be my Guard forever.

343
15:45.910 --> 15:47.080
You're still young.

344
15:47.320 --> 15:48.440
We are about to establish an

345
15:48.440 --> 15:50.360
anti-Japanese Red Army University.

346
15:50.360 --> 15:51.490
When the time comes,

347
15:51.550 --> 15:52.750
you should go sign up.

348
15:53.240 --> 15:54.910
Chairman Mao, I already told you,

349
15:54.910 --> 15:56.240
I'm not going anywhere.

350
16:06.080 --> 16:07.320
Rivers.

351
16:07.360 --> 16:09.120
Rivers.

352
16:09.120 --> 16:10.270
Mountains and streams.

353
16:10.270 --> 16:11.840
Mountains and streams.

354
16:11.910 --> 16:13.630
Rivers, mountains, and streams.

355
16:13.630 --> 16:16.360
Rivers, mountains, and streams.

356
16:16.390 --> 16:17.390
The Yellow River.

357
16:17.440 --> 16:18.790
The Yellow River.

358
16:18.910 --> 16:19.960
The Yangtze River.

359
16:19.960 --> 16:21.320
The Yangtze River.

360
16:21.360 --> 16:23.120
The Yellow River and the Yangtze River.

361
16:23.120 --> 16:25.630
The Yellow River and the Yangtze River.

362
16:25.430 --> 16:28.860
[Wei Yueqiao, Staff Member of the 2nd Bureau of the Military Commission]

363
16:25.930 --> 16:28.970
Children, have any of you been to the Yellow River?

364
16:29.550 --> 16:30.320
Sir,

365
16:30.320 --> 16:31.910
I've been to the Yellow River!

366
16:31.910 --> 16:33.120
Then tell us,

367
16:33.140 --> 16:34.870
what does the Yellow River look like?

368
16:34.870 --> 16:37.120
The Yellow River is very big and long,

369
16:37.200 --> 16:39.200
and the sound of the water is rumbling

370
16:39.200 --> 16:40.510
just like thunder.

371
16:40.630 --> 16:42.670
How can river water sound like thunder?

372
16:42.670 --> 16:43.390
Sir,

373
16:43.390 --> 16:45.000
is what they say true?

374
16:45.390 --> 16:47.030
What does the Yellow River really look like?

375
16:47.030 --> 16:48.840
Don't just listen to what others say.

376
16:48.840 --> 16:52.030
You have to see it for yourselves when you grow up to really know.

377
16:52.030 --> 16:52.790
Kids,

378
16:53.200 --> 16:56.630
our country is just too big.

379
16:57.240 --> 16:59.100
We have not only the Yellow River,

380
16:59.240 --> 17:00.790
but also the Yangtze River,

381
17:01.550 --> 17:03.750
the Songhua River, and the Pearl River.

382
17:04.000 --> 17:05.520
We also have Mount Tai,

383
17:05.880 --> 17:09.640
Mount Emei, Mount Hua, and the Changbai Mountains.

384
17:09.829 --> 17:12.160
Generation after generation of Chinese people

385
17:12.160 --> 17:13.480
have lived

386
17:13.480 --> 17:15.339
among these rivers and mountains

387
17:15.880 --> 17:17.069
and grown up here.

388
17:18.030 --> 17:19.680
Read it again with me.

389
17:19.680 --> 17:20.480
River.

390
17:20.750 --> 17:22.000
River.

391
17:22.030 --> 17:22.829
River.

392
17:22.960 --> 17:24.160
River.

393
17:24.240 --> 17:25.030
Mountain.

394
17:25.030 --> 17:26.160
Mountain.

395
17:26.270 --> 17:27.069
Stream.

396
17:27.069 --> 17:28.109
Stream.

397
17:28.440 --> 17:29.750
Rivers.

398
17:29.880 --> 17:31.240
Rivers.

399
17:31.720 --> 17:32.880
Mountains and streams.

400
17:32.880 --> 17:34.480
Mountains and streams.

401
18:02.720 --> 18:03.770
Chairman Mao.

402
18:07.590 --> 18:08.520
Little comrade,

403
18:09.440 --> 18:11.100
where did you get these seeds?

404
18:11.110 --> 18:13.110
I bought them from a local villager.

405
18:13.720 --> 18:15.580
So, how long until we can harvest?

406
18:15.640 --> 18:18.200
The villager said as long as we give them enough water,

407
18:18.200 --> 18:19.440
the vegetables will grow fast.

408
18:19.440 --> 18:21.170
We should be able to harvest them soon.

409
18:21.170 --> 18:22.490
Harvest them soon?

410
18:22.750 --> 18:23.590
Yes, soon.

411
18:23.830 --> 18:25.880
Everyone in our squad treats them like treasure.

412
18:25.880 --> 18:28.280
We take turns watering and loosening the soil.

413
18:28.280 --> 18:29.920
They will definitely grow even faster.

414
18:29.920 --> 18:31.970
We'll keep a couple of plants for seeds.

415
18:31.970 --> 18:33.720
That way, we can plant another crop in the autumn.

416
18:33.720 --> 18:34.920
In that case, when the time comes,

417
18:34.920 --> 18:36.920
I want to taste the vegetables you grew!

418
18:36.920 --> 18:38.110
Don't be stingy.

419
18:38.440 --> 18:39.070
I won't be.

420
18:39.070 --> 18:40.640
I'll stir-fry a big plate for you.

421
18:40.640 --> 18:41.350
Great.

422
18:44.110 --> 18:44.920
Chairman Mao,

423
18:47.350 --> 18:48.160
Chairman Mao.

424
18:49.000 --> 18:50.630
Can I shake your hand again?

425
18:52.240 --> 18:54.270
Have we shaken hands before?

426
18:55.440 --> 18:56.970
The first time was in Gouba.

427
18:57.030 --> 18:58.240
You shook my hand.

428
18:59.070 --> 19:01.310
Back then, everyone ran over to grab my hand and shake it.

429
19:01.310 --> 19:03.660
My old squad leader was the first to rush over.

430
19:03.660 --> 19:05.070
He was so jealous.

431
19:05.270 --> 19:06.750
For days, he kept muttering,

432
19:06.750 --> 19:08.550
"If only I could shake Chairman Mao's hand,

433
19:08.550 --> 19:10.210
how wonderful that would be."

434
19:12.270 --> 19:14.110
What's your old squad leader's name?

435
19:14.110 --> 19:15.160
Where is he now?

436
19:20.110 --> 19:21.440
His name is Guo Shanlin.

437
19:22.350 --> 19:22.880
He...

438
19:23.070 --> 19:25.110
while marching through the grasslands,

439
19:25.110 --> 19:26.440
he sacrificed his life.

440
19:27.480 --> 19:28.610
He starved to death.

441
19:29.750 --> 19:30.640
So,

442
19:31.160 --> 19:33.560
could I shake your hand again on his behalf?

443
20:28.200 --> 20:31.460
Guo, Guo,

444
20:33.350 --> 20:34.720
did you see that?

445
20:36.350 --> 20:36.790
Look.

446
20:50.510 --> 20:51.310
Changfeng,

447
20:52.720 --> 20:54.790
I still hope you'll reconsider

448
20:55.200 --> 20:57.860
about going to the Red Army University to study.

449
20:58.000 --> 21:00.160
Whether it's you or Wu,

450
21:01.030 --> 21:02.630
once you reach the right age,

451
21:02.680 --> 21:06.400
I hope you can all become eagles spreading your wings,

452
21:07.440 --> 21:10.000
soaring into your own skies.

453
21:11.110 --> 21:11.920
Chairman,

454
21:12.680 --> 21:13.770
I'll listen to you.

455
21:54.750 --> 21:56.680
Why are you sitting here all alone?

456
22:00.160 --> 22:02.200
Why did you decide to sit here too

457
22:02.640 --> 22:04.240
when you saw me sitting here?

458
22:10.070 --> 22:12.600
How are we going to resolve the Wayaobu issue?

459
22:13.510 --> 22:15.170
Are we going to yield it or not?

460
22:15.270 --> 22:16.920
My mind is quite a mess.

461
22:17.030 --> 22:18.480
Wayaobu is a good place.

462
22:19.640 --> 22:20.720
Giving it up

463
22:22.110 --> 22:23.170
is heartbreaking.

464
22:27.240 --> 22:28.920
I understand how you feel.

465
22:31.160 --> 22:33.550
You are the head of the Chinese Soviet Government's

466
22:33.550 --> 22:35.440
Northwest Office.

467
22:35.880 --> 22:39.960
That makes you the highest-ranking leader at the seat of the central government.

468
22:39.960 --> 22:41.830
You do need a place to work.

469
22:45.350 --> 22:46.830
But I still have to say,

470
22:47.240 --> 22:50.970
we shouldn't dwell on the gains and losses of a single city or place.

471
22:52.880 --> 22:54.640
If we keep the land but lose the people,

472
22:54.640 --> 22:56.500
both people and land will be lost.

473
22:57.680 --> 22:59.440
If we keep the people but lose the land,

474
22:59.440 --> 23:01.300
both people and land will be kept.

475
23:02.680 --> 23:06.110
We are giving up Wayaobu for the greater good of resisting Japanese aggression.

476
23:06.110 --> 23:06.970
It's not a loss.

477
23:08.200 --> 23:09.460
You make a valid point.

478
23:09.680 --> 23:10.610
Comrade Zedong,

479
23:11.920 --> 23:14.400
whenever we face multiple choices,

480
23:15.110 --> 23:17.970
you can always grasp the principal contradiction.

481
23:18.310 --> 23:19.960
So, where do we go next?

482
23:20.830 --> 23:22.030
Do you have any ideas?

483
23:24.640 --> 23:26.440
I don't have a concrete idea yet.

484
23:27.160 --> 23:30.730
But I think we can search as we go.

485
23:32.720 --> 23:35.590
On the one hand, we can send a dedicated working group

486
23:35.590 --> 23:38.650
to find a suitable foothold for the central committee.

487
23:38.880 --> 23:39.920
On the other hand,

488
23:40.240 --> 23:43.570
we should launch the western expedition as soon as possible

489
23:43.790 --> 23:45.200
to expand our base area.

490
23:46.880 --> 23:49.280
When we discussed the eastern expedition,

491
23:49.390 --> 23:52.310
you said the west and north were equally barren.

492
23:52.790 --> 23:55.480
Now you're advocating for a western expedition.

493
23:55.480 --> 23:57.680
Do we really have that much confidence?

494
23:57.750 --> 23:59.310
Just now on the way here,

495
24:01.000 --> 24:03.530
I saw Comrade Wei Yueqiao from the 2nd Bureau.

496
24:03.830 --> 24:07.920
He set up a Lenin School here

497
24:08.480 --> 24:10.400
to teach the kids here how to read.

498
24:12.590 --> 24:17.480
He was teaching the kids to read about rivers and mountains.

499
24:18.000 --> 24:20.270
He carried that small blackboard on his back,

500
24:20.270 --> 24:22.180
teaching all the way as he walked.

501
24:22.590 --> 24:25.590
He taught all the way from Ruijin to northern Shaanxi.

502
24:25.940 --> 24:26.790
I also met a

503
24:26.790 --> 24:28.920
young Squad Leader from the mess unit.

504
24:29.350 --> 24:31.480
To let his comrades have green vegetables,

505
24:31.480 --> 24:32.960
he bought seeds himself

506
24:34.160 --> 24:35.960
and planted a row of vegetables.

507
24:36.090 --> 24:38.350
He watered and fertilized them every day,

508
24:38.350 --> 24:41.920
hoping they would grow as soon as possible.

509
24:44.680 --> 24:45.480
Comrade Bo Gu,

510
24:45.960 --> 24:49.540
I believe you have seen such things too.

511
24:50.270 --> 24:51.920
The young Squad Leader was sowing seeds,

512
24:51.920 --> 24:54.110
and Wei Yueqiao was also sowing seeds.

513
24:54.550 --> 24:55.770
All of us

514
24:56.590 --> 24:59.120
are making our own contributions and efforts

515
24:59.670 --> 25:01.340
for this great cause.

516
25:03.720 --> 25:04.960
As long as we are here,

517
25:05.640 --> 25:07.160
and as long as these people are here,

518
25:07.160 --> 25:08.160
I believe that

519
25:08.960 --> 25:10.440
no matter where we go,

520
25:10.880 --> 25:13.200
this seed will be planted,

521
25:14.310 --> 25:15.970
and will take root and sprout.

522
25:16.880 --> 25:18.210
With these people here,

523
25:18.350 --> 25:20.880
I believe that as vast as northern Shaanxi is,

524
25:21.400 --> 25:24.530
everywhere can be a foothold for our Central Committee.

525
25:25.580 --> 25:26.510
Comrade Zedong,

526
25:27.000 --> 25:29.270
you always make accurate judgments

527
25:29.550 --> 25:31.200
at the most critical moments,

528
25:31.200 --> 25:32.470
propose the best strategies,

529
25:32.470 --> 25:35.400
and persuade everyone to unify their thinking.

530
25:36.960 --> 25:38.090
This kind of ability

531
25:38.880 --> 25:40.680
is hard for many people to possess.

532
25:40.680 --> 25:42.010
At least I don't have it.

533
25:43.790 --> 25:44.830
Comrade Bo Gu,

534
25:45.480 --> 25:48.130
have you learned to flatter me?

535
25:49.110 --> 25:50.110
Of course not,

536
25:51.030 --> 25:52.550
I'm telling the truth.

537
25:53.440 --> 25:54.750
You know me.

538
25:55.160 --> 25:57.350
Sometimes,

539
25:57.350 --> 25:58.720
when I look at certain issues,

540
25:58.720 --> 25:59.920
I can be a bit extreme.

541
26:01.200 --> 26:02.480
But when it comes to work,

542
26:02.480 --> 26:03.670
I tell it like it is.

543
26:07.210 --> 26:10.340
The other day, Enlai and I were talking about how

544
26:10.920 --> 26:12.920
we have gone through the Long March.

545
26:12.960 --> 26:14.690
Regarding everyone's growth,

546
26:14.850 --> 26:18.740
I think your progress is tremendous.

547
26:22.640 --> 26:23.440
Is that so?

548
26:23.590 --> 26:24.270
Yes.

549
26:25.590 --> 26:27.070
After the Zunyi Conference,

550
26:27.070 --> 26:30.270
all the comrades, including me, were worried about you,

551
26:30.550 --> 26:33.350
fearing you might never recover from the setback.

552
26:33.550 --> 26:34.350
But facts have proved that

553
26:34.350 --> 26:35.410
you, Comrade Bo Gu,

554
26:35.790 --> 26:37.750
didn't care about personal gains and losses.

555
26:37.750 --> 26:39.920
You have become increasingly pragmatic in your work,

556
26:39.920 --> 26:41.770
and more and more down-to-earth.

557
26:41.770 --> 26:42.960
The work of the General Political Department

558
26:42.960 --> 26:44.720
has been kept in perfect order by you.

559
26:44.720 --> 26:46.560
In the struggle against Zhang Guotao,

560
26:46.560 --> 26:48.350
you also rushed to the front line.

561
26:48.350 --> 26:50.320
After arriving in northern Shaanxi,

562
26:50.320 --> 26:52.250
you have also done a remarkable job

563
26:52.400 --> 26:54.400
as the Director of the Northwest Office

564
26:54.400 --> 26:56.070
of the Chinese Soviet Government.

565
26:56.070 --> 26:58.270
These are all your growth and progress.

566
26:58.510 --> 26:59.350
Comrade Bo Gu,

567
26:59.720 --> 27:02.400
you are now truly

568
27:02.580 --> 27:05.600
burning on the hot soil of the Chinese revolution.

569
27:26.300 --> 27:28.550
On May 18, 1936,

570
27:29.070 --> 27:32.070
according to the decision of the Politburo of the Central Committee,

571
27:32.070 --> 27:35.110
Mao Zedong, Chairman of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission,

572
27:35.110 --> 27:38.160
and Vice Chairmen Zhou Enlai and Peng Dehuai issued the

573
27:38.160 --> 27:41.290
"Order of Action for the Western Expedition Campaign."

574
27:41.610 --> 27:43.940
It was decided that the 1st Front Red Army,

575
27:44.120 --> 27:46.160
the 1st and 15th Army Groups,

576
27:46.190 --> 27:48.830
as well as the 81st Division and the Cavalry Regiment,

577
27:48.830 --> 27:50.760
would form the Western Field Army.

578
27:50.830 --> 27:54.310
Commanded by Peng Dehuai as both Commander and Political Commissar,

579
27:54.310 --> 27:56.960
they would direct the troops to launch an offensive

580
27:56.960 --> 27:59.070
against the border regions of Shaanxi, Gansu, and Ningxia,

581
27:59.070 --> 28:01.270
to open up a new anti-Japanese base area

582
28:01.600 --> 28:03.580
and coordinate with the 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps

583
28:03.580 --> 28:05.710
and the 4th Front Army marching north.

584
28:06.080 --> 28:08.600
The 29th and 30th Armies,

585
28:08.630 --> 28:10.440
along with local forces in northern Shaanxi, would pin down

586
28:10.440 --> 28:14.350
the Central Army and the westward-crossing troops of the Jinsui Army.

587
28:14.350 --> 28:16.920
The 28th Army would head out to southern Shaanxi

588
28:16.920 --> 28:20.160
to coordinate with the actions of the Westward Expedition forces.

589
28:20.160 --> 28:22.640
On June 1, 1936,

590
28:22.720 --> 28:26.270
Chen Jitang joined forces with Li Zongren and Bai Chongxi of Guangxi

591
28:26.270 --> 28:28.790
raising troops against Chiang in the name of resisting Japan.

592
28:28.790 --> 28:31.880
This is historically known as the Guangdong-Guangxi Incident.

593
28:31.880 --> 28:33.290
The Japanese invasion of our country is becoming increasingly urgent.

594
28:32.740 --> 28:35.250
[Nanjing, Jiangsu]

595
28:33.720 --> 28:35.480
On one hand, they are engaging in large-scale smuggling;

596
28:35.480 --> 28:37.550
on the other hand, they are increasing troops in Beiping and Tianjin.

597
28:37.550 --> 28:40.480
Economic and military aggression are advancing simultaneously.

598
28:40.480 --> 28:42.210
Looking forward to the future,

599
28:42.580 --> 28:44.270
our deep worries know no bounds,

600
28:44.270 --> 28:45.620
as the times are critical and the situation is urgent.

601
28:45.620 --> 28:46.550
We believe that

602
28:46.580 --> 28:48.270
if we don't immediately resist Japan,

603
28:48.270 --> 28:50.350
our nation will certainly not survive.

604
28:50.350 --> 28:52.030
We need to have a unified stance,

605
28:52.030 --> 28:55.720
and immediately command the nation to engage in anti-Japanese resistance.

606
28:55.720 --> 28:56.830
That would be the great fortune of our Party and nation.

607
28:56.830 --> 28:58.160
All right, all right.

608
28:58.830 --> 29:01.210
Every time before dispatching troops,

609
29:02.030 --> 29:05.110
Chen Jitang looks for a bunch of soothsayers and charlatans

610
29:05.110 --> 29:06.830
to perform spirit-writing and divination.

611
29:06.830 --> 29:08.360
Did he do it again this time?

612
29:09.920 --> 29:10.800
I heard,

613
29:11.590 --> 29:12.160
yes.

614
29:12.240 --> 29:14.500
So what was the result of the divination?

615
29:15.240 --> 29:16.400
Same as before.

616
29:16.590 --> 29:17.350
It said

617
29:17.670 --> 29:20.110
[Qian Dajun, Director of the First Office of the Attendants' Office of the Chairman of the Military Affairs Commission of the Nationalist Government]

618
29:19.440 --> 29:20.300
your time is up.

619
29:23.620 --> 29:26.720
It's more than that.

620
29:27.040 --> 29:28.520
In his hexagrams,

621
29:28.540 --> 29:30.400
I have died at least a dozen times.

622
29:30.720 --> 29:31.980
But every single time,

623
29:32.350 --> 29:34.210
I have disappointed him greatly.

624
29:34.770 --> 29:35.440
Yes.

625
29:38.160 --> 29:39.420
Chen Jitang claimed to

626
29:39.440 --> 29:41.440
support resistance against Japan,

627
29:41.460 --> 29:42.190
but in secret

628
29:42.190 --> 29:44.280
he was colluding with the Japanese.

629
29:46.270 --> 29:48.550
Didn't he take a lot of Japanese military aid?

630
29:48.550 --> 29:51.210
Like anti-tank guns, machine guns, airplanes.

631
29:51.400 --> 29:52.800
Didn't he get all of them?

632
29:53.270 --> 29:56.070
He even invited Japanese military advisors over.

633
29:57.680 --> 29:59.920
So what is he really thinking deep down?

634
30:05.030 --> 30:07.030
It's for his own selfish interests,

635
30:12.480 --> 30:14.070
to loot a burning house.

636
30:14.750 --> 30:15.680
Generalissimo,

637
30:15.880 --> 30:18.280
Chen does indeed harbor ulterior motives.

638
30:18.400 --> 30:19.860
How do you plan to respond?

639
30:21.350 --> 30:22.960
Someone told me

640
30:24.000 --> 30:26.260
to send troops to put down the rebellion.

641
30:26.350 --> 30:28.310
However, I'm not in a hurry.

642
30:29.200 --> 30:31.630
I want to hear your thoughts first.

643
30:35.720 --> 30:39.270
Although Chen is flying the banner of resisting Japan,

644
30:39.550 --> 30:42.110
anyone with eyes can see through it.

645
30:42.270 --> 30:43.270
That banner of his

646
30:43.510 --> 30:46.100
won't fool anyone.

647
30:46.590 --> 30:47.480
However,

648
30:48.310 --> 30:49.590
most of our Central Army units

649
30:49.590 --> 30:52.000
have already pursued the Communist army to the north.

650
30:52.000 --> 30:54.590
There aren't enough troops in Guangdong, Guangxi, Hunan, and Hubei.

651
30:54.590 --> 30:56.200
Together, the Guangdong and Guangxi armies

652
30:56.200 --> 30:57.680
totaled 300,000 men.

653
30:57.830 --> 30:58.590
What's more,

654
30:58.720 --> 31:00.650
He Jian has always sat on the fence.

655
31:00.880 --> 31:02.010
Once war breaks out,

656
31:02.240 --> 31:03.680
if the battle doesn't go well,

657
31:03.680 --> 31:05.030
the consequences would be unimaginable.

658
31:05.030 --> 31:07.090
Therefore, I believe that right now,

659
31:07.640 --> 31:09.750
we must not rashly use force against Guangdong and Guangxi.

660
31:09.750 --> 31:12.000
At the very least, we shouldn't start a war directly.

661
31:12.000 --> 31:14.110
That is also what I am concerned about.

662
31:14.110 --> 31:15.350
You should know,

663
31:15.750 --> 31:17.640
it is not just Guangdong and Guangxi.

664
31:17.640 --> 31:19.970
Domestically, and even within the Party,

665
31:20.110 --> 31:22.170
many people want to rebel against me.

666
31:22.880 --> 31:25.830
"You are not a fish, how do you know the joy of fishes?"

667
31:26.350 --> 31:27.480
You know what?

668
31:28.070 --> 31:31.030
Among this bustling crowd of people crossing the river,

669
31:31.030 --> 31:33.870
how many desires and ambitions are hidden?

670
31:34.350 --> 31:36.510
But you are not me,

671
31:37.200 --> 31:39.930
how do you know that I don't know the joy of fishes?

672
31:41.350 --> 31:43.350
I just won't let them have their way.

673
31:43.960 --> 31:44.960
Cixiu,

674
31:45.240 --> 31:47.500
tell me what specific thoughts you have.

675
31:47.590 --> 31:48.710
My specific thought is, first, send troops

676
31:48.710 --> 31:51.110
to block the vital route of the Guangdong-Guangxi armies.

677
31:51.110 --> 31:53.310
and then seek a strategy for an internal resolution.

678
31:53.310 --> 31:55.270
This lifeline you are referring to is...

679
31:55.270 --> 31:56.070
Hengyang.

680
31:56.750 --> 31:57.970
For the Guangdong and Guangxi armies to advance north,

681
31:57.970 --> 31:59.110
they must first pass through Hunan.

682
31:59.110 --> 32:00.030
To enter Hunan,

683
32:00.030 --> 32:01.680
they need to occupy Hengyang first.

684
32:01.680 --> 32:04.680
Our army can dispatch elite troops to seize Hengyang,

685
32:04.790 --> 32:06.970
to block the path for the Guangdong and Guangxi armies to advance north.

686
32:06.970 --> 32:07.270
Then...

687
32:07.270 --> 32:09.070
We can buy time and wait for the best moment

688
32:09.070 --> 32:11.420
to resolve this incident.

689
32:11.790 --> 32:13.070
Is that what you mean?

690
32:13.070 --> 32:13.830
Exactly.

691
32:14.240 --> 32:14.920
Good.

692
32:18.200 --> 32:18.830
Muyin (Qian Dajun).

693
32:18.830 --> 32:19.440
Here!

694
32:19.480 --> 32:21.350
Just follow what Cixiu just said,

695
32:21.350 --> 32:22.680
and formulate military deployments.

696
32:22.680 --> 32:24.790
Furthermore, tell Dai Yunong (Dai Li),

697
32:24.790 --> 32:27.270
I want to see his response plan as soon as possible.

698
32:27.270 --> 32:28.030
Yes.

699
32:31.750 --> 32:33.500
To win without taking the field

700
32:34.130 --> 32:35.460
is the ruler's victory;

701
32:36.310 --> 32:37.510
to win through battle

702
32:37.970 --> 32:39.400
is the general's.

703
32:40.420 --> 32:43.000
Troops must never be raised out of anger.

704
32:43.960 --> 32:45.590
Act when victory is in sight;

705
32:45.720 --> 32:47.440
stop when it is not.

706
32:47.590 --> 32:49.050
The one who understands me

707
32:49.160 --> 32:50.510
is Cixiu.

708
32:50.860 --> 32:51.790
If the generals

709
32:51.820 --> 32:53.690
were more like you,

710
32:54.440 --> 32:56.240
my burden would be much lighter.

711
32:56.310 --> 32:57.480
You're giving me too much credit.

712
32:57.480 --> 32:58.440
Cixiu, as commander-in-chief of

713
32:58.440 --> 33:02.160
the anti-Communist campaign in Shanxi, Shaanxi, Suiyuan, and Ningxia,

714
33:02.160 --> 33:03.820
tell me your deployment plan.

715
33:03.920 --> 33:05.960
Rest assured, Generalissimo.

716
33:06.030 --> 33:07.160
Before coming to Nanjing,

717
33:07.160 --> 33:08.960
I ordered the Central Army, the Jinsui Army,

718
33:08.960 --> 33:10.550
the Northwestern Army, and the Northeastern Army

719
33:10.550 --> 33:11.880
to advance by building blockhouses

720
33:11.880 --> 33:13.480
and pincer the Communist Army from the north and south.

721
33:13.480 --> 33:14.920
Among them, the Northeastern Army's

722
33:14.920 --> 33:18.030
67th Corps and 105th Division divided into three routes

723
33:18.030 --> 33:20.200
to attack the Communist headquarters in the north,

724
33:20.200 --> 33:20.920
Wayaobu.

725
33:21.070 --> 33:21.750
Very good.

726
33:22.000 --> 33:23.350
As for the Northeastern Army,

727
33:23.350 --> 33:25.750
if Zhang Xueliang weren't being kept in check,

728
33:25.750 --> 33:27.950
my hotheaded sworn brother knows no end

729
33:28.310 --> 33:30.070
to the trouble he could cause.

730
33:30.550 --> 33:31.810
Keep a close eye on him.

731
33:31.920 --> 33:32.510
Yes.

732
33:32.790 --> 33:33.680
Also,

733
33:33.680 --> 33:35.350
though the war in Guangdong and Guangxi is urgent,

734
33:35.350 --> 33:37.550
it is not as urgent as northern Shaanxi.

735
33:37.600 --> 33:38.510
Cixiu,

736
33:38.600 --> 33:40.190
we must be clear in our minds

737
33:40.350 --> 33:41.920
that our greatest enemy,

738
33:42.080 --> 33:44.180
the biggest threat to the Party,

739
33:45.720 --> 33:46.910
is in Wayaobu.

740
33:47.420 --> 33:48.270
Yes.

741
33:50.270 --> 33:54.260
[Wayaobu, Shaanxi, 3rd Bureau of the Military Commission]

742
34:12.920 --> 34:16.139
[Wang Zheng, Director of the 3rd Bureau of the Military Commission]

743
34:15.460 --> 34:16.429
Commanders,

744
34:16.760 --> 34:18.219
the decoding is complete.

745
34:19.929 --> 34:21.860
What did the Comintern say, Luofu?

746
34:21.960 --> 34:23.480
They asked a question:

747
34:24.480 --> 34:26.630
When Comrade Chen Yun came to Moscow,

748
34:27.150 --> 34:29.590
where did he hide the letter?

749
34:29.610 --> 34:30.449
What?

750
34:34.510 --> 34:35.590
This question

751
34:36.070 --> 34:37.980
could only have been asked by Comrade Chen Yun,

752
34:37.980 --> 34:40.510
and only Comrade Zedong and I could answer it.

753
34:40.880 --> 34:41.670
Why?

754
34:41.989 --> 34:43.969
I remember when Comrade Zedong and I

755
34:43.969 --> 34:45.860
saw Comrade Chen Yun off,

756
34:45.960 --> 34:48.550
we saw him put the letter written by Comrade Liu Bocheng

757
34:48.550 --> 34:51.409
into the bottom compartment of the bamboo thermos.

758
34:52.440 --> 34:53.580
Reply with this answer.

759
34:53.580 --> 34:54.389
Yes.

760
34:57.360 --> 35:00.280
Bamboo thermos...

761
35:00.800 --> 35:01.600
the bottom...

762
35:01.710 --> 35:02.610
It's been over a year.

763
35:02.610 --> 35:03.590
The compartment.

764
35:03.590 --> 35:05.220
We have finally

765
35:05.320 --> 35:08.050
established direct contact with the Comintern.

766
35:08.290 --> 35:10.540
On June 16, 1936,

767
35:10.950 --> 35:13.090
the CPC Central Committee and the Comintern

768
35:13.090 --> 35:15.360
restored radio communication.

769
35:15.770 --> 35:18.570
Zhang Wentian immediately sent a telegram to the CPC delegation to the Comintern

770
35:18.570 --> 35:21.970
in the name of the Central Secretariat,

771
35:22.280 --> 35:25.400
briefing them on the Party and Red Army situation

772
35:25.640 --> 35:28.550
after the Central Committee's arrival in northern Shaanxi.

773
35:28.550 --> 35:30.960
In mid-June 1936,

774
35:31.100 --> 35:32.970
under Chiang Kai-shek's strict orders, the 67th Corps of the Northeastern Army

775
35:32.970 --> 35:36.320
and the 105th Division,

776
35:35.750 --> 35:39.590
[Shaanxi-Gansu Revolutionary Base Area]

777
35:36.360 --> 35:39.360
advanced and attacked towards Wayaobu.

778
35:39.690 --> 35:41.440
The CPC Central Committee gave full consideration

779
35:41.440 --> 35:43.150
to the needs of united front work,

780
35:43.150 --> 35:43.300
and various organs

781
35:43.300 --> 35:45.980
gradually withdrew from Wayaobu,

782
35:46.230 --> 35:48.070
relocating to Zhidan County.

783
35:48.420 --> 35:49.400
At the same time,

784
35:49.950 --> 35:51.980
the northward-marching 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps

785
35:51.980 --> 35:54.040
crossed multiple snow-capped mountains

786
35:54.040 --> 35:56.170
after making tremendous sacrifices.

787
35:57.300 --> 35:59.820
On June 22, 1936,

788
36:00.410 --> 36:04.160
the 6th Red Army Corps arrived at Puyulong, near Ganzi,

789
36:04.540 --> 36:08.340
joining forces with the general headquarters of the 4th Front Army.

790
36:08.640 --> 36:09.510
On June 30,

791
36:10.160 --> 36:13.120
He Long and Ren Bishi led the 2nd Red Army Corps

792
36:13.140 --> 36:15.540
to Rongbacha near Ganzi,

793
36:16.080 --> 36:18.570
joining forces with the 30th Red Army.

794
36:19.230 --> 36:22.390
Zhu De and Liu Bocheng went to welcome them.

795
36:25.630 --> 36:29.460
[Rongbacha, Sichuan]

796
36:32.020 --> 36:33.280
I never expected this.

797
36:33.360 --> 36:34.760
So for the past half year,

798
36:34.910 --> 36:37.000
the orders and instructions we received

799
36:37.000 --> 36:38.320
were all issued by Zhang Guotao

800
36:38.320 --> 36:40.920
under the false name of the Central Committee.

801
36:41.280 --> 36:42.070
No wonder.

802
36:42.990 --> 36:44.820
We called the Central Committee several times to ask about

803
36:44.820 --> 36:46.880
the situation with them and 1st Front Red Army.

804
36:46.880 --> 36:48.320
He didn't reveal a single thing.

805
36:48.320 --> 36:49.510
This might sting a little.

806
36:49.510 --> 36:51.070
We always treated his telegrams

807
36:51.070 --> 36:53.840
as directives from the Military Commission.

808
36:54.320 --> 36:55.150
Yes,

809
36:55.190 --> 36:56.920
it was like that for a long time.

810
36:57.000 --> 36:59.600
He sent telegrams in the names of Zhu and Zhang,

811
36:59.670 --> 37:00.670
and often,

812
37:01.000 --> 37:02.320
he bypassed the Commander-in-Chief.

813
37:02.320 --> 37:03.550
A few days ago, in a telegram

814
37:03.550 --> 37:05.420
Wang Zhen sent me, he also mentioned that

815
37:05.420 --> 37:07.540
when they arrived at Jiawa Town,

816
37:07.760 --> 37:08.840
Zhang Guotao

817
37:09.480 --> 37:12.110
specially sent a stack of "What Every Cadre Should Know".

818
37:12.110 --> 37:13.920
It was full of nonsense.

819
37:14.980 --> 37:17.360
Feeling something was wrong, he didn't distribute them.

820
37:17.360 --> 37:18.510
Looking back now,

821
37:18.760 --> 37:21.230
Zhang Guotao was quite calculating.

822
37:25.110 --> 37:28.110
Is this any way for a Communist Party member to behave?

823
37:30.150 --> 37:32.110
Back during the Nanchang Uprising,

824
37:32.110 --> 37:34.630
I already felt that Zhang Guotao wasn't honest.

825
37:34.630 --> 37:36.960
Sooner or later, his true colors would show.

826
37:36.960 --> 37:37.890
Comrade He Long,

827
37:38.070 --> 37:39.150
the situation now

828
37:39.590 --> 37:40.450
is much better.

829
37:40.670 --> 37:43.030
Earlier, Comrade Lin Yuying, who returned from the Comintern,

830
37:43.030 --> 37:45.070
and the Central Committee

831
37:45.070 --> 37:46.640
repeatedly sent telegrams to Zhang Guotao.

832
37:46.640 --> 37:48.120
Plus, more and more

833
37:48.270 --> 37:51.230
comrades in the 4th Front Army have recognized the situation

834
37:51.230 --> 37:52.490
and kept advising him.

835
37:52.880 --> 37:54.480
Zhang Guotao couldn't hold out any longer.

836
37:54.480 --> 37:57.030
At the meeting of party activists held in Luhuo

837
37:57.030 --> 37:58.550
on the 6th of this month,

838
37:58.630 --> 37:59.670
he abolished

839
37:59.670 --> 38:01.930
that "Second Central Committee" of his.

840
38:03.000 --> 38:03.670
Yes.

841
38:04.210 --> 38:06.960
Although he still claims

842
38:07.230 --> 38:08.840
not to be under the leadership of the Central Committee,

843
38:08.840 --> 38:09.700
proposing to be

844
38:09.760 --> 38:13.070
directly managed by the CPC delegation to the Comintern,

845
38:13.550 --> 38:14.280
ultimately,

846
38:14.670 --> 38:16.840
he has agreed to lead the troops north.

847
38:17.150 --> 38:19.000
Many comrades from the 4th Front Army

848
38:19.000 --> 38:21.530
have also realized Zhang Guotao's mistakes.

849
38:21.800 --> 38:23.030
Our pressing task now

850
38:23.100 --> 38:25.480
is to unite with them and head to northern Shaanxi together.

851
38:25.480 --> 38:26.360
Reaching northern Shaanxi

852
38:26.360 --> 38:27.320
means victory.

853
38:29.280 --> 38:31.740
Commander-in-Chief, you can rest assured.

854
38:31.800 --> 38:34.470
Our 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps are the Party's troops.

855
38:34.470 --> 38:35.460
Wherever the Party tells us to go,

856
38:35.460 --> 38:36.380
we go.

857
38:36.580 --> 38:37.710
Once we reach Ganzi,

858
38:38.000 --> 38:39.190
the first thing I'll do

859
38:39.190 --> 38:41.520
is ask Zhang Guotao for the secret cipher.

860
38:41.550 --> 38:43.030
From now on, the 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps

861
38:43.030 --> 38:44.630
will report our work directly to the Central Committee.

862
38:44.630 --> 38:45.440
Exactly.

863
38:45.880 --> 38:46.760
It seems

864
38:47.190 --> 38:47.910
that our suggestion back then

865
38:47.910 --> 38:49.960
for you to head north and join forces with us

866
38:49.960 --> 38:51.020
was the right move.

867
38:54.860 --> 38:58.960
[Welcome Rally for the 2nd and 6th Army Corps]

868
38:56.540 --> 38:58.780
On July 1, 1936,

869
38:58.920 --> 39:02.030
the 2nd and 6th Army Corps arrived in Ganzi County.

870
39:03.280 --> 39:05.400
A great reunion

871
39:05.400 --> 39:06.840
forged by iron will

872
39:06.840 --> 39:09.960
and blood sacrifice.

873
39:25.560 --> 39:27.360
Comrades, come have some milk tea!

874
39:27.360 --> 39:28.840
You've worked hard!

875
39:29.750 --> 39:33.420
[Zhou Suyuan, Commander of the Guizhou Anti-Japanese National Salvation Army]

876
39:31.150 --> 39:33.590
Old comrade, are you also from the 2nd and 6th Army Corps?

877
39:33.590 --> 39:34.580
Of course.

878
39:34.960 --> 39:36.020
Have some milk tea.

879
39:36.760 --> 39:38.470
Great, thank you!

880
39:38.790 --> 39:42.980
Thank you! Thank you!

881
39:42.190 --> 39:45.080
[Zhang Zhenhan, Tactics Instructor at the Red Army School and Former Lieutenant General Commander of the KMT 42nd Division]

882
39:43.000 --> 39:44.000
Enough for me!

883
39:44.030 --> 39:45.230
Thank you! Thank you!

884
39:45.440 --> 39:46.550
You've worked hard, comrades.

885
39:46.550 --> 39:48.840
Thank you! Thank you!

886
39:54.220 --> 39:55.280
It looks like a robe.

887
39:55.280 --> 39:57.540
You're still young and will grow taller.

888
39:59.330 --> 40:01.040
I can't march wearing this.

889
40:06.110 --> 40:07.630
This fits well, come here.

890
40:08.530 --> 40:09.790
Commander-in-Chief,

891
40:09.830 --> 40:11.830
the comrades from the 4th Front Army

892
40:11.850 --> 40:13.100
are truly wonderful.

893
40:13.200 --> 40:14.950
Yes, they are all very sincere.

894
40:15.190 --> 40:17.000
They are genuinely

895
40:17.000 --> 40:18.260
welcoming our troops.

896
40:19.100 --> 40:20.030
This scene

897
40:20.070 --> 40:23.000
also happened when the 1st and 4th Front Armies joined forces.

898
40:23.000 --> 40:24.320
Everyone's feelings

899
40:24.320 --> 40:25.780
were quite similar to now.

900
40:26.030 --> 40:28.630
But later, he took it in the wrong direction.

901
40:28.920 --> 40:30.110
Welcome!

902
40:30.880 --> 40:31.740
Comrade Bishi,

903
40:32.000 --> 40:33.190
we meet again.

904
40:33.360 --> 40:34.290
Comrade Guotao,

905
40:34.400 --> 40:35.440
long time no see.

906
40:35.440 --> 40:38.030
Yes, we have finally joined forces.

907
40:38.230 --> 40:41.060
Indeed. When the conference is over later,

908
40:41.080 --> 40:42.880
I need to get something from you.

909
40:42.950 --> 40:43.800
What is it?

910
40:43.920 --> 40:44.850
The cipher code.

911
40:46.190 --> 40:47.690
Sure, sure.

912
40:49.280 --> 40:50.210
Comrade He Long,

913
40:50.790 --> 40:53.120
we have finally joined forces in victory.

914
40:53.710 --> 40:54.440
Yes, indeed.

915
40:55.590 --> 40:56.520
Comrade Guotao,

916
40:57.030 --> 41:00.000
you look like you've gained quite a bit of weight

917
41:00.000 --> 41:01.660
since the Nanchang Uprising.

918
41:01.680 --> 41:02.320
Yeah.

919
41:03.770 --> 41:05.230
It's been a tough journey for you all.

920
41:05.230 --> 41:06.830
Stop with the pleasantries.

921
41:06.920 --> 41:08.000
Along the way,

922
41:08.000 --> 41:09.670
under your command,

923
41:09.840 --> 41:10.800
we've crossed quite a few snow-capped mountains

924
41:10.800 --> 41:12.190
and fought many tough battles.

925
41:12.190 --> 41:13.460
We've suffered huge losses

926
41:13.460 --> 41:15.070
and are in desperate need of supplies.

927
41:15.070 --> 41:16.590
Could you, as the General Commissar,

928
41:16.590 --> 41:17.920
give us some men and horses

929
41:17.920 --> 41:20.580
from your 4th Front Army to replenish our ranks?

930
41:22.230 --> 41:24.000
Sure, sure.

931
41:25.280 --> 41:26.340
Comrade Wang Zhen,

932
41:26.750 --> 41:29.000
which unit does "sure" mean?

933
41:33.550 --> 41:34.590
Comrade He Long,

934
41:34.660 --> 41:37.060
how come you are still so straightforward?

935
41:37.400 --> 41:39.800
I see you still like to beat around the bush!

936
41:40.170 --> 41:41.630
I'm asking you a question!

937
41:43.070 --> 41:44.360
The venue is ready.

938
41:44.360 --> 41:45.840
Chiefs, please come in.

939
41:45.940 --> 41:47.390
This way, please.

940
41:50.030 --> 41:51.710
Come on, the meeting is starting!

941
41:51.710 --> 41:53.670
The meeting is starting!

942
42:06.400 --> 42:08.800
Comrades of the 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps, welcome!

943
42:08.800 --> 42:10.920
You have worked hard.

944
42:10.920 --> 42:12.880
Great!

945
42:20.000 --> 42:21.070
Just now,

946
42:21.190 --> 42:24.480
we received a congratulatory telegram from the Central Committee in northern Shaanxi,

947
